WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.458
Roxy had to find out what Mr. Presto was up to.

2
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:10.108
"Hey, guys," she said to her friends.

3
00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:14.449
"I just remembered I have to help my mom with chores.

4
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:23.663
I'll be back soon."

5
00:00:23.664 --> 00:00:27.314
Roxy found Detective Smith at the TV station.

6
00:00:27.315 --> 00:00:31.457
He was looking at some equipment.

7
00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:34.570
"Where's Mr. Presto?" Roxy asked.

8
00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:37.770
"I don't know," said the detective.

9
00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:41.297
"He was gone before I got here."

10
00:00:41.298 --> 00:00:46.956
Roxy smirked. "I'm surprised Mighty Man didn't stop him."

11
00:00:46.957 --> 00:00:50.831
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

12
00:00:50.832 --> 00:00:56.591
"Mighty Man isn't a real superhero like you, Rocket Girl."

13
00:00:56.592 --> 00:01:01.177
"We need to find out what Mr. Presto's doing," Roxy told him.

14
00:01:01.178 --> 00:01:04.973
Detective Smith nodded. "Yes, I think—"

15
00:01:04.974 --> 00:01:08.751
"Help!" A voice cried out from behind a door.

16
00:01:08.752 --> 00:01:12.612
Roxy looked around. "That sounded like . . ."

17
00:01:12.613 --> 00:01:16.121
"Mighty Man!" said Detective Smith.

18
00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:18.368
Roxy ran to the door.

19
00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:21.375
It was locked.

20
00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:26.693
Whiz-hoo! Roxy blasted it open with her eye laser beams.

21
00:01:26.694 --> 00:01:29.919
The Mighty Man actor was inside a small room.

22
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.360
The TV crew was with him.

23
00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.478
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the actor.

24
00:01:38.479 --> 00:01:41.278
"No problem," Roxy said.

25
00:01:41.279 --> 00:01:46.002
"Do you know where Mr. Presto went?" asked Detective Smith.

26
00:01:46.003 --> 00:01:48.486
"No," said another man.

27
00:01:48.487 --> 00:01:51.064
"He stole a camera and left.

28
00:01:51.065 --> 00:01:56.066
But we can find out what he's doing."

29
00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:58.810
The man turned on a monitor.

30
00:01:58.811 --> 00:02:02.630
Mr. Presto appeared on the screen.

31
00:02:02.631 --> 00:02:06.707
He held a wand in one hand and a microphone in the other.

32
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:10.057
Metro City Bank was in the background.

33
00:02:10.058 --> 00:02:13.122
Mr. Presto walked over to a woman.

34
00:02:13.123 --> 00:02:15.676
The woman wore a diamond necklace.

35
00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:20.089
"Hello!" said Mr. Presto. "What's your name?"

36
00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.778
"Molly," said the woman.

37
00:02:22.779 --> 00:02:26.850
"What a lovely name!" said Mr. Presto.

38
00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:29.900
"I'm going to show you a magic trick, Molly!"

39
00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:31.802
He waved his wand.

40
00:02:31.803 --> 00:02:35.500
"One, two, three . . . Presto!"

41
00:02:35.501 --> 00:02:38.652
Poof! Molly's necklace disappeared.

42
00:02:38.653 --> 00:02:40.763
Mr. Presto looked at the camera.

43
00:02:40.764 --> 00:02:46.132
"Is everyone enjoying my show?"

44
00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:49.907
Next Mr. Presto walked over to a man.

45
00:02:49.908 --> 00:02:52.920
"Hello, sir!" said Mr. Presto.

46
00:02:52.921 --> 00:02:57.874
"Ooh! That's a very nice watch you're wearing."

47
00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:01.196
"Uh, thank you," said the man.

48
00:03:01.197 --> 00:03:05.001
"Do you like magic?" asked Mr. Presto.

49
00:03:05.002 --> 00:03:07.490
"Yes," said the man.

50
00:03:07.491 --> 00:03:10.854
"Watch this," said Mr. Presto.

51
00:03:10.855 --> 00:03:12.705
He waved his wand.

52
00:03:12.706 --> 00:03:16.270
"One, two, three . . . Presto!"

53
00:03:16.271 --> 00:03:20.537
Poof! The watch was gone!

54
00:03:20.538 --> 00:03:23.134
And so was Roxy.

55
00:03:23.135 --> 00:03:26.569
She had to stop Mr. Presto from stealing things!

56
00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.585
Detective Smith was still watching the monitor.

57
00:03:29.586 --> 00:03:32.372
"Rocket Girl, we need to do something.

58
00:03:32.373 --> 00:03:35.987
Mr. Presto is . . . Rocket Girl?

59
00:03:35.988 --> 00:03:42.330
Where did she go?"

